# Public-repo media: ignore everything here, then re-include ONLY what a judge-facing
# surface actually renders. `assets/` in the private project is the canonical home for all
# project media; scripts/sync-assets.sh copies a superset of it into this folder, and
# without this file every one of those lands in the public repository whether or not
# anything links to it.
#
# Verified before writing: README.md is the only file in this repository that references
# docs/assets/*, and it references exactly these two. The app's own icon and social card
# are served from packages/nextjs/public/ (`/icon.svg`, `/og-image.png`) — separate copies,
# unaffected by anything here.
#
# Adding a new image? Reference it, then re-include it below. If it needs no rule, nothing
# renders it.
*
!.gitignore
!icon-animated.svg
!readme-hero-animated.svg
